# ===============================================
# 📚 DOCUMENTATION FILES - ENHANCED PROTECTION
# ===============================================
# Include public documentation, exclude sensitive details

# ❌ SENSITIVE ROOT-LEVEL DOCUMENTATION (MUST NOT be tracked)
BUGS_AND_FIXES.md                     # Contains security vulnerabilities, implementation details, admin access patterns
PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md                  # Contains internal architecture and sensitive file paths
REFACTORING_SUMMARY.md               # Personal learning tool and internal development notes
ARCHITECTURE_UPDATE_COMPLETE.md      # Internal completion status and development workflow
GIT_WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md                # Internal git workflow and security guidelines
DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md               # Contains implementation timelines and sensitive feature details
DOCUMENTATION_STRUCTURE_INSTRUCTIONS.md  # Internal documentation guidelines
DOCUMENTATION_GUIDELINES.md          # Internal documentation standards
*_COMPLETE.md                        # Internal status files and development artifacts
*_SUMMARY.md                         # Internal implementation summaries
*_GUIDE.md                           # Internal setup and configuration guides
*_INSTRUCTIONS.md                    # Internal development instructions

# ❌ PRIVATE DOCUMENTATION DIRECTORY (MUST NOT be tracked)
PRIVATE_DOCS/                         # Contains all sensitive internal documentation
*_PRIVATE/                            # Any private documentation directories

# ❌ SENSITIVE DOCUMENTATION DIRECTORY FILES (MUST NOT be tracked)
DOCUMENTATION/CORE/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md        # Contains detailed internal architecture and sensitive implementation details
DOCUMENTATION/CORE/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md          # Contains sensitive database structure and medical data schema
DOCUMENTATION/SUMMARIES/BUGS_AND_FIXES.md      # Contains security vulnerabilities and implementation details
DOCUMENTATION/SUMMARIES/*IMPLEMENTATION*.md    # Contains internal implementation details
DOCUMENTATION/SUMMARIES/*_SUMMARY.md           # Internal implementation summaries
DOCUMENTATION/SUMMARIES/*_COMPLETION*.md       # Internal completion status files
DOCUMENTATION/GUIDES/GIT_WORKFLOW_GUIDE.md     # Contains internal security procedures
DOCUMENTATION/GUIDES/DOCUMENTATION_GUIDELINES.md # Contains internal documentation standards
DOCUMENTATION/GUIDES/PRIVACY_PROTECTION_NOTICE.md # Contains sensitive privacy strategies
DOCUMENTATION/GUIDES/*_GUIDE.md                # Internal setup and configuration guides
DOCUMENTATION/GUIDES/*_INSTRUCTIONS.md         # Internal development instructions

# ❌ OAUTH AND CONFIGURATION DOCUMENTATION (MUST NOT be tracked)
*OAUTH*.md                           # Contains OAuth configuration details and security setup
*CONFIG*.md                          # Contains configuration details and setup procedures
*SETUP*.md                           # Contains setup procedures and internal guidelines
*FIX*.md                             # Contains fix implementations and security details
*TROUBLESHOOTING*.md                 # Contains internal troubleshooting procedures

# Sensitive configuration and setup files
temp_admin_setup.js
*admin_setup*
debug.keystore
*.keystore

# ❌ TEST AND DIAGNOSTIC SCRIPTS (MUST NOT be tracked)
test-*.sh                            # Test scripts containing configuration details
test-*.js                            # Diagnostic scripts with environment variables
debug-*.js                           # Debug scripts with sensitive configuration
verify-*.js                          # Verification scripts with internal details
diagnose-*.js                        # Diagnostic tools with system information
check-*.sh                           # Check scripts with configuration validation

# Firebase Configuration (SENSITIVE - contains API keys)
firebase/firebaseConfig.ts
firebaseConfig.ts

# Firestore Rules (SENSITIVE - contains security model)
firestore.rules

# Internal Data Schemas (SENSITIVE - contains database structure)
DATABASE_SCHEMA.md
*_schema.md
*_schema.ts
internal_docs/

# These files contain detailed internal information:
# - BUGS_AND_FIXES.md: Contains security vulnerabilities, Firebase details, admin access patterns
# - PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md: Contains sensitive internal details and file structure
# - REFACTORING_SUMMARY.md: Personal learning tool and internal notes
# - ARCHITECTURE_UPDATE_COMPLETE.md: Internal completion status
# - Any *_COMPLETE.md files: Internal status files

# Note: Only high-level architecture documentation should be public.
# Detailed internal structure, security details, and personal learning notes
# must remain private for security and professionalism.

